    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Got something happening you want to promote? Add the event to your site in seconds with images, links, maps and a simple registration form. If there are attendance costs the plugin does all the maths for you. The shortcode is [aer].</p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Event creation</li>\n<li>Event featured image</li>\n<li>Links to event website and maps</li>\n<li>Registration form</li>\n<li>Registration management</li>\n</ul>\n",
